# Build artifacts
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LaTeX build artifacts (docs/*.tex sources and their compiled .pdf are
# tracked; these intermediates are regenerated by pdflatex, not source)
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.out
docs/*.toc

# Everything under results/ (meshes, Elmer mesh directories, .sif, .vtu,
# .result, ROOT files, JSON, HTML, ...) is regenerated by running the
# geometry/elmer/macros/visualization scripts in order -- see
# docs/reference.md "出力ディレクトリ構成". Only the check-image PNGs
# under results/img/ are kept in git, as verification evidence -- plus
# one specific curated GIF (README.md's front-page avalanche animation,
# 2026-09-25). That filename is deliberately fixed/generic (not tied to a
# specific event/run) so a future, better animation can just overwrite it
# in place -- README.md's embed doesn't need to change when it does.
results/*
!results/img/
results/img/*
!results/img/*.png
!results/img/avalanche_demo.gif
